WEBVTT

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.210
Good morning.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.880
1 Item
From: Kiyoura Setsuna
Subject: I'm sorry

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:56.780
I wish I could have told you in a better way, but I'm sorry that it ended up being an e-mail. I kept thinking I needed to tell you, but it was just too hard to say, I just ended up e-mailing you instead. I'm sorry.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.790
It's pretty cold. Think it'll snow?

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.620
If you think about it, it's pretty strange.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:21.910
What is?

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:29.770
I tried to bring you to comfort Sekai and now even I'm sleeping with you.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:32.620
Why are you bringing that up now?

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:33.870
No reason.

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:39.200
It's just... I know I'm doing something bad to Sekai.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.640
Want to try to see her tomorrow?

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.260
Aren't you worried?!

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.300
Hey!

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:54.060
You know she's been out for so long that she's might not have many absences left!

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.910
Too much trouble.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.930
That's what you say, but...

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.300
You've just got something planned with another girl.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:06.040
Received Calls

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:06.040
Since Sekai isn't around,
you're going after every girl in sight.

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:08.050
I'm only after you.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:09.290
Idiot.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:13.780
You're really a jerk.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:16.610
So are you.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:17.790
I guess so.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.700
Everything's just a pain.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:21.700
Hey!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.390
We only went around the booths!

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.900
You're lying! You're lying! You're lying!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:25.260
I already know where you and Katou-san went...

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:26.750
Why?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.250
Just why?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.160
What?

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.100
Am I not enough for you?

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.150
I only have you left...

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:40.610
Setsuna's gone. You're the only one I have.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.660
Please, Makoto...

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.330
Hey!

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:08.000
Itou's sister came over.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.020
I see...

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:12.420
Maybe I should have dragged him here?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.430
W-Wait!

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.590
Sorry, I don't feel like talking right now.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.220
Oh, um...

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:24.110
Oh yeah, Nanami's been pretty down lately.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.760
Sounds like something bad happened on her team.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.840
I know it was a shock that Setsuna transferred,

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:35.450
but maybe if you at least show up,
people won't be so worried about you.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:40.470
And besides, if you're not there Itou might cheat on you, or something.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.940
1 Item
To: Itou Makoto
Your mail could not be sent

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:51.950
020 Failed Itou Makoto

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:12.920
Please leave a message within 30 seconds after the beep.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:16.550
Makoto, where are you? Jeez...

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.590
Otome-chan, let's go home already!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.760
Hold on, help me find Makoto.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:25.000
That has nothing to do with us.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.300
You're the ones that pushed me into this, right?!

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.880
That's true, but...

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.380
Yeah, but...

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.300
Take responsibility!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.710
You put the oil on the fire and now this?

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.820
Don't take it out on us!

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.790
Fine!

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:42.280
I thought Katsura finally gave up and now this...

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.940
Otome's changed recently.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.190
She's always getting pissed. Kinda annoying.

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:50.020
It all started after that, right?

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:52.020
Oh, you mean <i>that</i>.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.280
That was amazing!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.040
You watched?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.800
Well, I helped film, you know.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.700
You're not even fazed...

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:06.840
Well, yeah, I was embarrassed, but it was between us girls. And it was Makoto...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.660
Right. I'm glad you had a good time.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:14.360
Jeez, this girl and Otome...

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.240
I guess we can't lose, too.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:19.570
Natsumi?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:24.050
I wonder how good Itou actually is.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.920
You mean...

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.630
God, we had to do it here again?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.210
Who cares?

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.920
This place isn't used that often, so we don't really have to be worried that someone's gonna find us.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:37.900
Hey...

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.870
What is it? Wanna go another time?

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.310
Jerk, not that!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:45.510
Are you really okay with not going to see Sekai?!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:50.530
If you have time to mess around with me, then go visit her!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.320
God.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.530
It'll be okay, we'll...

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:13.030
Yeah, we'll invite Saionji-san again and we'll eat on the roof.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:16.670
I'll do my best at making lunch for us.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:20.680
The number you have dialed cannot be reached due to a number of reasons

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.680
I'll fill it with all the things you like.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.950
and cannot be connected at the current time.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:26.680
It's okay, my mom told me I've gotten better.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:26.680
The number you have dialed cannot be reached due to a number of reasons

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.390
Yeah, I'll take care of it.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.390
and cannot be connected at the current time.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:32.890
The number you have dialed cannot be reached due to a number of...

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.580
I want to see you right now.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.220
I can't hold back any longer.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.220
I like you more.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.220
I'll bring Itou to you, so wait there.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:00.680
Welcome.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.690
Wow, you were serious.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.610
Who cares?

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.200
You were the ones who suggested it.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:14.700
You can't back out now that you're here.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.890
Yeah, but...

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.460
Itou

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.630
It might be nice to stay on the yacht for Christmas.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:47.630
Did you know that seeing the sun setting over the the ocean is really pretty?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:53.990
1 Item
From: Kiyoura Setsuna
Itou should be in front of your house now.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.490
1 Item
From: Kiyoura Setsuna
I took it for you. Here you go.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.440
Setsuna!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.430
Makoto!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.530
I couldn't...

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:59.100
Sekai...

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.080
Uh....

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.380
I need to talk to you.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.290
Do you have a moment?

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.470
Wh-What is it?

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.190
It's important.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.350
I didn't have it.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.990
Didn't have it? What?

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.180
My period.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.600
Does that mean you're...?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.680
Y-You're lying, right?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.600
You think I could lie or joke about this?!

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:45.020
I haven't done anything like that with anyone but you!

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.210
You're the only one!

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.130
That doesn't mean it's mine...

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:51.520
Whose would it be?!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.790
But we're still in high school...

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.030
Yeah, but...

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:00.160
Can't you do anything about it?

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.870
That's why I wanted to talk to you!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:06.690
But I don't know what to do.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.870
This is your child we're talking about!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.360
Take it seriously!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.460
Did you hear?

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.970
Yeah, that's pretty bad.

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:52.610
But...

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:56.300
That's right. It'll be Makoto's...

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.920
...child.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.140
We'll be fine, right?

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.960
We used protection.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:06.860
Well, yeah...

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:10.020
But what should we do now?

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:12.530
We probably shouldn't see him for a while.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:13.600
Yeah.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.890
Kind of sucks.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.940
You have a boyfriend. You don't get to say that.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.080
What does she want me to do?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.060
That's what you get.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:36.990
You didn't use protection?

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:41.880
I still didn't know what was up back then.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.590
So, I kind of rushed...

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.530
You're a guy, you should take responsibility.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.240
Yeah, but...

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.060
Hey, where are you going?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:14:00.860
I feel like people are going to look at me weird too, if I'm with you too much.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:08.980
That's him. You know.

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:12.880
That's him? He's sure getting around even though he looks like a guy that keeps to himself.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.110
You mean he gets around too much?

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:17.780
Guys sure have it easy. Once they've finished, they're done.

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.800
Girls have it tough.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.110
So what is he going to do?

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:21.810
Probably...

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.820
Address Book
Itou Makoto

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.310
He left early?

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:29.860
Well you know, I don't blame him.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.900
He's getting all that attention...

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.050
So where is she?

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:35.890
She's probably still in the nurse's office, no?

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.930
God!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.450
Why did Sekai have to go and say that?

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.460
Otome!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:15.190
Yeah, yeah!

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:17.930
I'm free right now.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.410
I was so free I was worried.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:24.370
Yeah, go ahead! Come over!

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:34.800
Welcome!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.050
Yeah.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.050
Otome?

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.720
There's something I want to ask you.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:45.620
If it's about Sekai, that wasn't my fault!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:49.870
I see...

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:53.420
Yeah, so don't worry about it.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:57.770
Makoto, you didn't used to be someone who'd say something like that.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.710
You were a lot nicer back in middle school.

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.580
Well, that's...

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.940
I've heard enough.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.320
I'm going home.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.310
Wai-!

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:09.550
Bye-bye.

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:23.450
Idiot.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:41.470
I'm so unlucky before Christmas.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.080
Unlucky?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.580
Oh, I know. Let's borrow your boyfriend next, Kumi.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:47.930
That might be a good idea!

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.620
No! We're not doing that!

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.730
Who cares? It's not like he's in short supply.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.490
He is.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.030
Short supply of what exactly?

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:06.150
Yeah, I'm sorry. I guess I made you worry, too.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.630
Oh, I'm fine now.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:12.630
Makoto? I asked him to go out and buy a few things.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:16.150
Yeah, I need to eat healthy.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.150
Yeah, sure.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.520
Oh, sorry about that.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.760
Thanks, I'll talk to you later.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:35.130
Sorry, I won't go near him anymore.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:45.880
I did some research.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:50.890
It turns out my dad has some connections at Sakakino Hills and...

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:53.030
...I was able to get us a room there.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:58.280
Yeah, let's meet near the tree in front of the train station.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:04.420
And then we can really be boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.320
Otome...

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.880
The party cannot answer the phone at this time.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:58.330
Please leave a your name and message after the beep within thirty seconds.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.590
Great!

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:01.690
Hikari...

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:09.910
The party cannot answer the phone at this time. Please leave a your name-

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:15.130
The party cannot answer the phone at this time-

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.900
The party cannot answer the phone at this time-

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:22.040
What's up with everyone?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.810
How come they're not picking up.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:27.610
Damn it!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.130
Why is this happening to me?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:37.600
Everything was going really well just a little while ago.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:40.620
Why is this...?

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:46.650
Katsura Kotonoha

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.890
That urban legend, huh?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.250
I didn't expect you to be into trends like that.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:06.250
Urban legend, huh?

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.620
Kotonoha...

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:11.490
Makoto-kun.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:20.500
I'm happy. You came for me, didn't you?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.380
U-Uh, yeah...

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.100
What have you been doing? Getting all this snow on you.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:31.930
I've been waiting.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.450
I've been waiting for you.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.950
Kotonoha...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:51.730
Makoto...

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:58.580
Saionji-san said she'd wish me the best, too.

00:20:58.580 --> 00:20:59.190
Huh?

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:06.540
That's why I have to become the best girl for you.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.480
Kotonoha...

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:15.220
Cooking and sewing... I have to practice more...

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:20.290
So that I can proudly be by your side.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:23.960
Kotonoha?

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:27.630
I'm going to become a girlfriend you're not embarrassed to have.

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.080
Kotonoha!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.880
I'm doing it for you.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.700
Come on! Hey!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.490
I want to be useful to you...

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.700
Hey! What happened to you?!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.890
I want to be with you.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.230
Please stop doing this...

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:45.320
I trust you.

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.220
Stop already...

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:52.380
I'm your girlfriend.

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.720
No more...

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:00.130
I love you.

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.650
I love you a lot.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:06.870
How? Why?

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.140
Why do you love someone like me?

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:16.880
I-I didn't know...

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:18.550
Forgive me...

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.810
I'm really sorry.

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:24.780
I'm... I'm...

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.430
Kotonoha, I...

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:31.360
I...

00:23:02.260 --> 00:23:04.030
Makoto-kun.

00:24:48.840 --> 00:24:53.010
Next time
School Days
